    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A truly stunning 3 bedroom semi-detached family home situated in sought after residential development of Avourwen, Drogheda, Co. Meath. Arranged over 2 floors, this property has been completed to impressively high standards throughout and has a floor area that extends to c. 113 sq.m (c. 1,216 sq.ft).  This house has bright and spacious living areas that would suit a growing family. Within 15 minute’s walk of Drogheda Town Centre the property is also surrounded with a wealth of amenities and services including shops, restaurants, schools, and other transport services. Viewing is highly advised."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
