        "Content": "Accommodation Includes\r\nEntrance Hallway\r\nLiving Room\t\t(4.07m x 4.39m)\r\nDining Room\t\t(3.33m x 4.73m)\r\nKitchen\t\t(3.05m x 3.00m)\r\nUtility Room\t\t(1.97m x 1.33m)\r\nGuest WC\t\t(1.33m x 1.68m)\r\n\r\n1st floor\r\nLanding\r\nBedroom 1  \t\t(3.47m x 4.19m)\r\nEn suite       \t\t(2.37m x 1.28m)\r\nBedroom 2\t\t(3.11m x 3.83m)\r\nBedroom 3\t\t(2.70m x 2.72m)\r\nMain Bathroom\t(1.66m x 2.37m"
